    "notes": "Red Horizon season sniper build: 4-piece Hotshot with Headshot Damage on every piece and every mod, around Iron Will. Its Resolved talent treats your next body shot as a headshot in PvE, on a 2-second cooldown, and needs no headshot kill to start.\n\nPlay loop: let Resolved convert a body shot, and land real headshots while it is on cooldown. Save the converted shot for Elites.\n\nSecondary talent: Ranger, or another direct-damage talent.\n\nAlternative: a Model 700 Headhunter build (Chainkiller chest, Determined on the rifle) has a higher ceiling for accurate players. Determined changed this season: a real headshot kill prepares one converted headshot, and a kill with that converted shot does not retrigger it."
